2. Fullscreen — hard limit, no workaround

The expand button triggers browser-native fullscreen. The video element leaves the app's DOM layer entirely. Nothing in Power Apps can paint over it. No z-order, no reorder, no PCF trick.

Only real option: build your own expand button, hide nothing, just resize inside the app.

Button OnSelect:

Set(varBig, !varBig)

Video1:

Width = If(varBig, App.Width - 40, 700)
Height = If(varBig, App.Height - 200, 400)

Caption label formulas already reference Video1.Width/Height → follows automatically.

Users must use YOUR button, not the native one. Native fullscreen = captions gone.

